WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.667
Seen this before?

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:05.147
You asked to learn — and you got more to read.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.387
And it's still not clicking.

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:11.053
So we made Keating.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:14.073
You do the thinking.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:20.373
Keating helps it click — a teacher that starts with your goals, and builds on what you already know.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.360
Ask it anything, and it asks you something back.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.220
Not another wall of text.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.560
A question you can actually answer.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.780
Choose your model.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.020
Shape your teacher.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.480
Take your data with you.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.600
It's open source.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:42.900
New in Keating 4: talk it through out loud, with GPT Live.

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:51.993
Local recall brings back what you said before, on your own device — so reviews and courses pick up where you left off.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:55.447
Independent reviews propose what could change.

00:00:55.807 --> 00:00:57.487
You decide what sticks.

00:00:58.167 --> 00:01:01.027
In your browser — or right in your terminal.

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:04.227
Done offloading?

00:01:04.487 --> 00:01:05.787
Ready to think for yourself?

00:01:06.327 --> 00:01:07.747
Start at keating.help.
